# Rest Api users

This is a REST API created with **Node.js** and **Express**, which includes an interactive HTML view to interact with user data. The application allows you to perform basic operations such as getting, creating, updating and deleting users, as well as viewing the data directly in the browser.

## Features

- REST API with CRUD operations for users:
  - Get users

## Prerequisites

Before installing and running the application, make sure you have installed:

- **Node.js** (version 14 or higher)
- **npm** (Node.js package manager)

## Installation

1. Clone this repository:

   git clone https://github.com/tu-usuario/mi-api-vista.git
   cd my-api-vista
### Install the dependencies:

    npm install
### Execute
Start the server:
    node index.js
### Open your browser and go to:

    http://localhost:3000
### API Paths
    Get all users
    Method: GET
    URL: /users
    Response:
    json

    [
    { “id”: 1, “name”: “John” },
    { “id”: 2, “name”: “Ana” }
    ]

### Technologies Used.
    Node.js: JavaScript execution environment.
    Express: Minimalist framework to create the server.
    jQuery: For the interaction with the API from the view.
    Bootstrap: For responsive design.
    HTML/CSS: For the structure and styles of the view.
